"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Übung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">29</div><h1>관계문</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Relativsätze</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 29의 문법을 직접 풀어 보며 익혀요.<br>B1 수준의 문장으로, 기본 16 · 중간 8 · 도전 6 문제를 풀어요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 연습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">앞 명사의 성·수와 관계문 속 역할로 관계대명사를 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">관계문의 동사를 맨 끝에 놓고 앞뒤에 쉼표를 찍어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">전치사 + 관계대명사와 소유의 dessen·deren을 써요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">alles·nichts·최상급·문장 전체 뒤의 was, 장소의 wo, 일반적인 사람의 wer를 써요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Der Bäcker, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> an der Ecke seinen Laden hat, backt das beste Brot der Stadt.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) dessen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) der</button></div><div class=\"qe\">남성 명사 Bäcker가 관계문의 주어(가게를 가진 사람)라서 1격 der예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;die&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Die Jacke, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Jacke · 여성)</span> du mir geschenkt hast, ist wirklich warm.</div><div class=\"qko\">네가 선물해 준 재킷은 정말 따뜻해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Jacke, <b>die</b> du mir geschenkt hast, ist wirklich warm.</div>schenken의 목적어(4격)이고 여성이라서 die예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Das Mädchen, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> wir den Weg erklärt haben, kam aus Spanien.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) das</button></div><div class=\"qe\">erklären은 '누구에게(3격) 무엇을(4격)'이에요. 길을 설명받은 사람이라서 3격, 중성 → dem.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;denen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Die Nachbarn, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:7ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Nachbarn · 복수)</span> wir beim Umzug geholfen haben, haben uns zum Essen eingeladen.</div><div class=\"qko\">이사할 때 우리가 도와준 이웃들이 우리를 식사에 초대했어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Nachbarn, <b>denen</b> wir beim Umzug geholfen haben, haben uns zum Essen eingeladen.</div>helfen은 3격 동사예요. 3격 복수 관계대명사는 denen이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> Der Koffer, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Koffer · 남성)</span> ich am Flughafen verloren habe, ist wieder da.</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 공항에서 잃어버린 여행 가방이 다시 돌아왔어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Der Koffer, <b>den</b> ich am Flughafen verloren habe, ist wieder da.</div>verlieren의 목적어(4격), 남성 → den.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Das Café das neben der Uni liegt ist immer voll&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">대학교 옆에 있는 카페는 늘 붐벼요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">immer</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Uni</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">neben</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">liegt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Café</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">voll</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Das Café, das neben der Uni liegt, ist immer voll.</b></div>관계문은 명사 바로 뒤에서 쉼표로 감싸고, 동사 liegt가 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;der&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Die Kollegin, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Kollegin · 여성)</span> dieser Schreibtisch gehört, ist heute krank.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 책상의 주인인 동료는 오늘 아파요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Kollegin, <b>der</b> dieser Schreibtisch gehört, ist heute krank.</div>gehören은 3격 동사예요. 여성 3격 → der.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Das ist der Kollege, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich jeden Morgen zur Arbeit fahre.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) mit dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) mit der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) mit den</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dem</button></div><div class=\"qe\">'~와 함께'는 mit + 3격이에요. 남성 3격 → mit dem.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dem&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> Das Dorf, in <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Dorf · 중성)</span> meine Großmutter aufgewachsen ist, liegt in den Bergen.</div><div class=\"qko\">할머니가 자란 마을은 산속에 있어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das Dorf, in <b>dem</b> meine Großmutter aufgewachsen ist, liegt in den Bergen.</div>in(위치)은 3격이에요. 중성 3격 → in dem.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;das&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> Das ist ein Thema, über <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Thema · 중성)</span> wir lange diskutiert haben.</div><div class=\"qko\">이것은 우리가 오래 토론한 주제예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist ein Thema, über <b>das</b> wir lange diskutiert haben.</div>diskutieren über + 4격이에요. 중성 4격 → über das.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> Ich kenne eine Familie, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Kinder alle ein Instrument spielen.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) deren</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) denen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dessen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞의 명사 Familie가 여성이라서 소유는 deren이에요. 뒤의 Kinder와는 상관없어요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;dessen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Mein Nachbar, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Nachbar · 남성)</span> Katze oft in unseren Garten kommt, ist sehr nett.</div><div class=\"qko\">고양이가 자주 우리 정원에 들어오는 이웃은 아주 친절해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Mein Nachbar, <b>dessen</b> Katze oft in unseren Garten kommt, ist sehr nett.</div>남성 명사의 소유는 dessen이에요. 뒤의 Katze가 여성이어도 dessen이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> Er hat mir nichts erzählt, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich nicht schon wusste.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) was</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) dass</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) wo</button></div><div class=\"qe\">nichts 뒤의 관계사는 was예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> Im Sommer fahre ich nach Salzburg, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> mein Onkel ein kleines Hotel hat.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">a) wo</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) was</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) in das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) das</button></div><div class=\"qe\">도시 이름 뒤에서 장소를 말할 때는 wo를 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;Wer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> morgen mitfahren will, muss sich bis heute Abend melden.</div><div class=\"qko\">내일 같이 가고 싶은 사람은 누구든 오늘 저녁까지 연락해야 해요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Wer</b> morgen mitfahren will, muss sich bis heute Abend melden.</div>'~하는 사람은 누구나'는 wer예요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Kennst du die Bäckerei die neben dem Bahnhof aufgemacht hat&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">역 옆에 문을 연 빵집 알아?</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">Kennst</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">dem</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">aufgemacht</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Bahnhof</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">die</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">du</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">Bäckerei</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">neben</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Kennst du die Bäckerei, die neben dem Bahnhof aufgemacht hat?</b></div>관계대명사 die가 주어예요. 현재완료의 보조 동사 hat이 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;hat&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">17.</strong> Die Bücher, die mein Vater mir geschenkt <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(haben)</span>, sind alle sehr alt.</div><div class=\"qko\">아버지가 나에게 선물해 준 책들은 모두 아주 오래됐어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Bücher, die mein Vater mir geschenkt <b>hat</b>, sind alle sehr alt.</div>관계문의 동사는 관계문의 주어(mein Vater)에 맞춰요. 앞의 Bücher(복수)가 아니에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">18.</strong> Der Mann, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich gestern im Park begegnet bin, war mein alter Mathelehrer.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) dessen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) der</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">begegnen은 sein과 쓰지만 3격 동사예요. 남성 3격 → dem.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">19.</strong> Das ist der Job, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> ich mich schon lange interessiere.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) für die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) an dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) für dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) für den</button></div><div class=\"qe\">sich interessieren für + 4격이에요. 남성 4격 → für den.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;auf&quot;],[&quot;die&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">20.</strong> Die Freunde, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(warten + 전치사)</span> <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Freunde · 복수)</span> ich am Samstag gewartet habe, sind nicht gekommen.</div><div class=\"qko\">토요일에 내가 기다린 친구들은 오지 않았어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Die Freunde, <b>auf</b> <b>die</b> ich am Samstag gewartet habe, sind nicht gekommen.</div>warten auf + 4격이에요. 복수 4격 → auf die.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Der Student dessen Handy klingelte wurde ganz rot&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">21.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">휴대폰이 울린 학생은 얼굴이 새빨개졌어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ganz</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">Student</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">rot</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">wurde</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">klingelte</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">Handy</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">dessen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Der</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Der Student, dessen Handy klingelte, wurde ganz rot.</b></div>dessen Handy가 관계문을 시작하고 동사 klingelte가 끝이에요.<br>관계문 뒤에 주문장의 동사 wurde가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">22.</strong> Sie hat endlich eine Wohnung gefunden, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> uns alle sehr freut.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) die</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) was</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) dass</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞 문장 전체(집을 구한 일)를 받을 때는 was예요.<br>die라면 Wohnung이 우리를 기쁘게 한다는 뜻이 돼요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;was&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">23.</strong> Das war das Spannendste, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ich je gesehen habe.</div><div class=\"qko\">그건 내가 지금까지 본 것 중에 가장 흥미진진한 것이었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das war das Spannendste, <b>was</b> ich je gesehen habe.</div>명사로 쓴 최상급 뒤에는 was를 써요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe gestern den Mann gesehen der früher hier gewohnt hat&quot;,&quot;Gestern habe ich den Mann gesehen der früher hier gewohnt hat&quot;,&quot;Ich habe den Mann gestern gesehen der früher hier gewohnt hat&quot;,&quot;Den Mann der früher hier gewohnt hat habe ich gestern gesehen&quot;,&quot;Ich habe gestern den Mann gesehen der hier früher gewohnt hat&quot;,&quot;Gestern habe ich den Mann gesehen der hier früher gewohnt hat&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">24.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">전에 여기 살던 남자를 어제 봤어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">gestern</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">Ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">Mann</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">hat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">gewohnt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">gesehen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">früher</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">hier</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe gestern den Mann gesehen, der früher hier gewohnt hat.</b></div>주문장 끝에 gesehen만 남으면 관계문을 그 뒤로 빼는 게 자연스러워요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">25.</strong> 틀린 문장은?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Die Kinder, denen der Ball gehört, spielen im Hof.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">b) Kennst du die Frau, dessen Tochter in meiner Klasse ist?</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Der Verein, bei dem mein Bruder Mitglied ist, sucht neue Trainer.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) Das ist alles, was ich dazu sagen kann.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞의 명사 Frau가 여성이라서 deren이어야 해요 — die Frau, deren Tochter …</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;die&quot;],[&quot;dessen&quot;],[&quot;die&quot;],[&quot;den&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">26.</strong> Gestern habe ich eine alte Freundin getroffen, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(Freundin · 여성)</span> ich seit der Schulzeit nicht mehr gesehen hatte. Sie erzählte mir von ihrem Mann, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 2\"><span class=\"qh\">(Mann · 남성)</span> Eltern aus Portugal kommen, und von der Firma, für <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 3\"><span class=\"qh\">(Firma · 여성)</span> sie jetzt arbeitet. Es war ein Abend, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 4\"><span class=\"qh\">(Abend · 남성)</span> ich nie vergessen werde.</div><div class=\"qko\">어제 학교 다닐 때 이후로 못 본 옛 친구를 만났어요. 친구는 부모님이 포르투갈 출신인 남편 이야기와 지금 일하는 회사 이야기를 해 줬어요. 절대 잊지 못할 저녁이었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Gestern habe ich eine alte Freundin getroffen, <b>die</b> ich seit der Schulzeit nicht mehr gesehen hatte. Sie erzählte mir von ihrem Mann, <b>dessen</b> Eltern aus Portugal kommen, und von der Firma, für <b>die</b> sie jetzt arbeitet. Es war ein Abend, <b>den</b> ich nie vergessen werde.</div>sehen의 목적어 → die, 남편의 부모 → dessen, für + 4격 → die, vergessen의 목적어 → den.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">27.</strong> 두 문장을 관계문으로 바르게 이은 것은?<br>Ich habe eine Kollegin. Auf ihren Rat kann ich mich immer verlassen.</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) Ich habe eine Kollegin, deren Rat ich mich immer verlassen kann.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) Ich habe eine Kollegin, auf deren Rat kann ich mich immer verlassen.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">c) Ich habe eine Kollegin, auf dessen Rat ich mich immer verlassen kann.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">d) Ich habe eine Kollegin, auf deren Rat ich mich immer verlassen kann.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">전치사 auf가 맨 앞, 소유는 여성 → deren, 동사 kann은 맨 끝이에요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;worauf&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">28.</strong> Endlich habe ich eine Stelle in Berlin bekommen – genau das, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(warten + 전치사)</span> ich so lange gewartet habe.</div><div class=\"qko\">드디어 베를린에 일자리를 얻었어요. 바로 내가 그렇게 오래 기다려 온 일이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Endlich habe ich eine Stelle in Berlin bekommen – genau das, <b>worauf</b> ich so lange gewartet habe.</div>das·etwas·alles 뒤에서 전치사가 필요하면 wo(r) + 전치사를 써요.<br>warten auf → worauf.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Das Fahrrad das ich mir letzten Monat gekauft habe ist schon kaputt&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">29.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">지난달에 산 자전거가 벌써 고장 났어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">letzten</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">gekauft</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">habe</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">mir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">Monat</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">schon</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"8\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"9\">Fahrrad</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"10\">kaputt</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"11\">Das</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Das Fahrrad, das ich mir letzten Monat gekauft habe, ist schon kaputt.</b></div>das가 kaufen의 목적어(중성 4격)예요. mir는 '나를 위해'라는 3격이에요.<br>관계문 뒤에 주문장 동사 ist가 와요.</div></div>\n<div class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">30.</strong> Das Konzert, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> wir uns so lange gefreut hatten, fiel leider aus.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">a) über das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">b) auf dem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\">c) auf das</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\">d) für das</button></div><div class=\"qe\">앞으로 있을 일을 기다리며 기뻐하는 것은 sich freuen auf + 4격이에요. 중성 → auf das.<br>über는 이미 일어난 일에 대한 기쁨이라서, 취소된 콘서트와 맞지 않아요.</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"30\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 30</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"